 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng n&agrave;y.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 c\\u1ee7a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i r\\u1ea5t \\u0111a d\\u1ea1ng n&ecirc;n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 &aacute;p d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n b\\u1ed5 sung ho\\u1eb7c c&aacute;c y&ecirc;u c\\u1ea7u v\\u1ec1 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m (bao g\\u1ed3m y&ecirc;u c\\u1ea7u v\\u1ec1 \\u0111\\u1ed9 tu\\u1ed5i). C&aacute;c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n b\\u1ed5 sung s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c cung c\\u1ea5p k&egrave;m theo D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 li&ecirc;n quan b\\u1ed5 sung v&agrave; c&aacute;c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n b\\u1ed5 sung \\u0111&oacute; s\\u1ebd tr\\u1edf th&agrave;nh m\\u1ed9t ph\\u1ea7n thu\\u1ed9c th\\u1ecfa thu\\u1eadn c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n v\\u1edbi ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c&aacute;c d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 \\u0111&oacute;.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<center>Quy \\u0111\\u1ecbnh v&agrave; \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n<\\/center>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><b>1.<\\/b><\\/span> Kh&ocirc;ng khuy\\u1ebfn kh&iacute;ch &eacute;p bu\\u1ed9c ch&egrave;o k&eacute;o tham gia s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 tr&ecirc;n websitle.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><b>2.<\\/b><\\/span> Kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ecbu b\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee9 m\\u1ed9t tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m v\\u1ec1 t\\u1ed5n th\\u1ea5t thi\\u1ec7t h\\u1ea1i v\\u1eadt ch\\u1ea5t hay tinh th&acirc;n n&agrave;o v\\u1ec1 vi\\u1ec7c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin tr&ecirc;n web.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><b>3.<\\/b><\\/span> Kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ecbu b\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee9 tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m n&agrave;o tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng th&ocirc;ng tin \\u0111\\u01b0a ra v&igrave; \\u0111&acirc;y ch\\u1ec9 l&agrave; tham kh\\u1ea3o cho ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d&ugrave;ng t&ugrave;y &yacute; l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><b>4.<\\/b><\\/span> Kh&ocirc;ng soi l&ocirc; \\u0111\\u1ec1 b&aacute;n s\\u1ed1 l&ocirc; \\u0111\\u1ec1 , c&aacute;c c\\u01b0\\u1ee3c v&agrave; c&aacute; \\u0111\\u1ed9 l&ocirc; \\u0111\\u1ec1 tr&aacute;i ph&eacute;p , kh&ocirc;ng cung c\\u1ea5p s\\u1ed1 ch\\u01a1i l&ocirc; \\u0111\\u1ec1.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><b>5.<\\/b><\\/span> Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ecbu tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m v\\u1ec1 vi\\u1ec7c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng th&ocirc;ng tin v&agrave;o m\\u1ee5c \\u0111&iacute;ch c&aacute; nh&acirc;n c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<center>Mi\\u1ec5n Tr\\u1eeb Tr&aacute;ch Nhi\\u1ec7m<\\/center>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><b>\\u2043<\\/b><\\/span> T\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 th&ocirc;ng tin m&agrave; tr&ecirc;n website soicaumb247.com ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i cung c\\u1ea5p ch\\u1ec9 mang t&iacute;nh ch\\u1ea5t tham kh\\u1ea3o, xin m\\u1ecdi ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch&uacute; &yacute; tu&acirc;n th\\u1ee7 ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt c\\u1ee7a n\\u01b0\\u1edbc s\\u1edf t\\u1ea1i, kh&ocirc;ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ph&eacute;p s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng th&ocirc;ng tin c\\u1ee7a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i \\u0111\\u1ec3 ti\\u1ebfn h&agrave;nh ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng phi ph&aacute;p. N\\u1ebfu kh&ocirc;ng, qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch s\\u1ebd ph\\u1ea3i ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n ch\\u1ecbu tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt. Web ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s\\u1ebd kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ecbu b\\u1ea5t k&igrave; tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m n&agrave;o.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><b>\\u2043<\\/b><\\/span> C&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin soicaumb247.com cung c\\u1ea5p, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c\\u1ed1 g\\u1eafng c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt th&ocirc;ng tin D\\u1ef1 \\u0110o&aacute;n K\\u1ebft Qu\\u1ea3 X\\u1ed5 S\\u1ed1 Ki\\u1ebfn Thi\\u1ebft Nh&agrave; N\\u01b0\\u1edbc, nh\\u01b0ng kh&ocirc;ng b\\u1ea3o \\u0111\\u1ea3m \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c hoa\\u0300n toa\\u0300n chi\\u0301nh xa\\u0301c. Th&ocirc;ng tin cung c\\u1ea5p ch\\u1ec9 cho tham kh\\u1ea3o, n\\u1ebfu th&ocirc;ng tin D\\u1ef1 \\u0110o&aacute;n KQXSKT tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc gi\\u1edd quay kh&ocirc;ng ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c g&acirc;y ra b\\u1ea5t k&igrave; t\\u1ed5n th\\u1ea5t n&agrave;o cho m\\u1ecdi ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s\\u1ebd kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ecbu tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><b>\\u2043<\\/b><\\/span> T\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 qu\\u1ea3ng ca\\u0301o tr&ecirc;n web ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i, \\u0111\\u1ec1u la\\u0300 y\\u0301 ki\\u1ebfn ca\\u0301 nh&acirc;n c\\u1ee7a kha\\u0301ch ha\\u0300ng, kh&ocirc;ng li&ecirc;n quan g&igrave; v\\u1edbi web ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><b>\\u2043<\\/b><\\/span> T\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng link qu\\u1ea3ng c&aacute;o tr&ecirc;n web ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i, b\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee9 h&igrave;nh th\\u1ee9c n&agrave;o, mi\\u1ec5n ph&iacute;, thu ph&iacute;, ho\\u1eb7c c&ocirc;ng &iacute;ch, \\u0111\\u1ec1u ph\\u1ea3i tu&acirc;n theo ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt quy \\u0111\\u1ecbnh, n\\u1ed9i dung kh&ocirc;ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c li&ecirc;n quan t\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng n\\u1ed9i dung c&oacute; h\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 vi ph\\u1ea1m ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt, ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ph\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ed9ng, m&ecirc; t&iacute;n, m\\u1ea1i d&acirc;m, v.v<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><b>\\u2043<\\/b><\\/span> N\\u1ebfu vi ph\\u1ea1m, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c&oacute; quy\\u1ec1n x&oacute;a b\\u1ecf \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng link li&ecirc;n quan b\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee9 khi n&agrave;o m&agrave; l\\u1ea1i kh&ocirc;ng ho&agrave;n l\\u1ea1i ph&iacute;, \\u0111\\u1ed3ng th\\u1eddi c&oacute; quy\\u1ec1n l\\u1ee3i v&agrave; ngh\\u0129a v\\u1ee5 c&ugrave;ng c&aacute;c b\\u1ed9 li&ecirc;n quan h\\u1ee3p t&aacute;c truy c\\u1ee9u.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",