(1205, 1, 'admin/category/2', 'PUT', '162.158.179.205', '{\"name\":\"Soi C\\u1ea7u\",\"slug\":\"soi-cau\",\"order\":\"2\",\"menu\":\"on\",\"status\":\"on\",\"title_web\":\"Soi C\\u1ea7u - Soi C\\u1ea7u 247\",\"meta_description\":null,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"list1\\\"><br>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h1 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18pt; color: #008000;\\\">Soi c\\u1ea7u MB 247 h&ocirc;m nay &ndash; D\\u1ef1 \\u0111o&aacute;n KQXS mi\\u1ec1n b\\u1eafc ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c mi\\u1ec5n ph&iacute; 100%<\\/span><\\/h1>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/soicaumb247.com\\/\\\">Soi c\\u1ea7u 247 h&ocirc;m nay<\\/a> \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ebfn l&agrave; m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ph&aacute;p soi c\\u1ea7u x\\u1ed5 s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111&ocirc;ng \\u0111\\u1ea3o ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u01a1i l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn. \\u0110\\u1ec3 hi\\u1ec3u h\\u01a1n v\\u1ec1 c&aacute;ch soi n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng ta h&atilde;y c&ugrave;ng nhau \\u0111i kh&aacute;m ph&aacute; n\\u1ed9i dung b&agrave;i vi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y d\\u01b0\\u1edbi \\u0111&acirc;y.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><img class=\\\"size-full wp-image-43723 aligncenter\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/soicaumb247.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/03\\/Soi-cau-mien-bac-dua-vao-ket-qua-giai-dac-biet.png\\\" alt=\\\"Soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n b\\u1eafc d\\u1ef1a v&agrave;o k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t\\\" width=\\\"435\\\"> <br>Soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n b\\u1eafc d\\u1ef1a v&agrave;o k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-size: 18pt; color: #008000;\\\">Soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n b\\u1eafc d\\u1ef1a v&agrave;o k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t<\\/span><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Ti\\u1ebfn h&agrave;nh soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n B\\u1eafc d\\u1ef1a v&agrave;o gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t s\\u1ebd l&agrave; m\\u1ed9t c&aacute;ch \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111&ocirc;ng \\u0111\\u1ea3o ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u01a1i v\\u1eadn d\\u1ee5ng. Trong \\u0111&oacute;, ti\\u1ebfn h&agrave;nh c&aacute;ch soi c\\u1ea7u d\\u1ef1a v&agrave;o gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c chia ra l&agrave;m 3 c&aacute;ch kh&aacute;c nhau:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: #ee0000;\\\">&raquo; C&aacute;ch 1<\\/span>: Anh em h&atilde;y ti\\u1ebfn h&agrave;nh th\\u1ed1ng k\\u1ebf, ki\\u1ec3m tra l\\u1ea1i nh\\u1eefng con l&ocirc; gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t \\u1edf trong tu\\u1ea7n. Trong tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p, trong tu\\u1ea7n c&oacute; s\\u1ef1 xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t c&oacute; ch\\u1ee9a s\\u1ed1 0 n\\u1eb1m \\u1edf gi\\u1eefa, ch\\u1eb3ng h\\u1ea1n nh\\u01b0 127092 th&igrave; anh em nu&ocirc;i ngay con s\\u1ed1 n&agrave;y t\\u1eeb 2 \\u0111\\u1ebfn 3 ng&agrave;y.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: #ee0000;\\\">&raquo; C&aacute;ch 2<\\/span>: \\u0110\\u1ed1i v\\u1edbi c&aacute;ch th\\u1ee9 2 n&agrave;y, anh em h&atilde;y d\\u1ef1a v&agrave;o ngay k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 c\\u1ee7a gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t n\\u1ed5 ra v&agrave;o ng&agrave;y th\\u1ee9 2. C&aacute;ch th\\u1ee9c th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n. Anh em ch\\u1ec9 vi\\u1ec7c l\\u1ea5y con s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti&ecirc;n c\\u1ee7a d&atilde;y s\\u1ed1 gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t v&agrave;o ng&agrave;y th\\u1ee9 2 \\u0111\\u1ec3 l&agrave;m s\\u1ed1 nu&ocirc;i trong nguy&ecirc;n 1 tu\\u1ea7n k\\u1ebf ti\\u1ebfp.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: #ee0000;\\\">&raquo; C&aacute;ch 3<\\/span>: \\u0110\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi c&aacute;ch th\\u1ee9 3, ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u01a1i c\\u1ea7n theo d&otilde;i k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 c\\u1ee7a gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t v&agrave;i ng&agrave;y th\\u1ee9 2. V&agrave; r\\u1ed3i, anh em h&atilde;y k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p 2 con s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti&ecirc;n c\\u1ee7a gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t ng&agrave;y th\\u1ee9 2 v&agrave; ng&agrave;y th\\u1ee9 3. C\\u0169ng c&oacute; th\\u1ec3, anh em h&atilde;y l\\u1ea5y t\\u1ed5ng 2 s\\u1ed1 n&agrave;y \\u0111\\u1ec3 l&agrave;m t\\u1ed5ng chu\\u1ea9n. \\u0110\\u1ed1i v\\u1edbi c&aacute;ch &agrave;m n&agrave;y, anh em n&ecirc;n nu&ocirc;i l&ocirc; trong l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng th\\u1eddi gian t\\u1eeb 5 \\u0111\\u1ebfn 7 ng&agrave;y nh\\u1eb1m n\\u0103ng cao c\\u01a1 h\\u1ed9i chi\\u1ebfn th\\u1eafng.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-size: 18pt; color: #008000;\\\">Soi c\\u1ea7u theo ki\\u1ec3u b\\u1ea1ch th\\u1ee7<\\/span><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi c&aacute;ch soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n B\\u1eafc d\\u1ef1a v&agrave;o b\\u1ea1ch th\\u1ee7 s\\u1ebd l&agrave; m\\u1ed9t ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ph&aacute;p nh\\u1ea5t \\u0111\\u1ecbnh anh em kh&ocirc;ng n&ecirc;n b\\u1ecf qua. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c bi\\u1ebft, \\u0111&acirc;y l&agrave; c&aacute;ch soi c\\u1ea7u \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111&ocirc;ng \\u0111\\u1ea3o ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u01a1i v\\u1eadn d\\u1ee5ng.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u1ec3 c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n soi c\\u1ea7u b\\u1ea1ch th\\u1ee7 l&ocirc;, ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u01a1i c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 v\\u1eadn d\\u1ee5ng nhi\\u1ec1u ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ph&aacute;p soi l&ocirc; kh&aacute;c nhau. V&agrave; r\\u1ed3i, anh em h&atilde;y l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn cho m&igrave;nh 1 con l&ocirc; duy nh\\u1ea5t v&agrave; ti\\u1ebfn h&agrave;nh nu&ocirc;i ch&uacute;ng t\\u1eeb 1 \\u0111\\u1ebfn 3 ng&agrave;y.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>M\\u1ed9t khi tham gia b\\u1ea1ch th\\u1ee7, anh em c\\u1ea7n nu&ocirc;i duy nh\\u1ea5t t\\u1eeb 1 con l&ocirc;. Ch&iacute;nh v&igrave; v\\u1eady, ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u01a1i h&atilde;y soi c\\u1ea7u m\\u1ed9t c&aacute;ch k\\u1ef9 l\\u01b0\\u1ee1ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ecdn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c cho m&igrave;nh con l&ocirc; th&iacute;ch h\\u1ee3p nh\\u1ea5t.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-size: 18pt; color: #008000;\\\">Soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n B\\u1eafc b\\u1eb1ng l&ocirc; r\\u01a1i<\\/span><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n B\\u1eafc b\\u1eb1ng l&ocirc; r\\u01a1i s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c &aacute;p d\\u1ee5ng theo nh\\u1eefng c&aacute;ch nh\\u01b0 sau:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><img class=\\\"size-full wp-image-43724 aligncenter\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/soicaumb247.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/03\\/Soi-cau-mien-Bac-bang-lo-roi.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n B\\u1eafc b\\u1eb1ng l&ocirc; r\\u01a1i\\\" width=\\\"435\\\" height=\\\"115\\\"><br>Soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n B\\u1eafc b\\u1eb1ng l&ocirc; r\\u01a1i<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt; color: #008000;\\\">B\\u1eaft l&ocirc; r\\u01a1i li&ecirc;n t\\u1ee5c trong 3 ng&agrave;y<\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Ti\\u1ebfn h&agrave;nh b\\u1eaft l&ocirc; r\\u01a1i li&ecirc;n t\\u1ee5c trong l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng th\\u1eddi gian 3 ng&agrave;y, ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u01a1i c\\u1ea7n th\\u01b0\\u1eddng xuy&ecirc;n theo d&otilde;i, t\\u1ed5ng h\\u1ee3p k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 x\\u1ed5 s\\u1ed1. V&agrave; r\\u1ed3i, anh em c\\u1ea7n t&igrave;m ki\\u1ebfm xem th\\u1eed c&oacute; con l&ocirc; n&agrave;o xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n 2 ng&agrave;y k\\u1ebf ti\\u1ebfp hay kh&ocirc;ng.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Th\\u01b0\\u1eddng l\\u1ec7, khi l&ocirc; \\u0111&atilde; r\\u01a1i th&igrave; s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c n\\u1ed5 ra trong 3 ng&agrave;y k\\u1ebf ti\\u1ebfp. Ch&iacute;nh v&igrave; v\\u1eady, khi anh em th\\u1ea5y 1 l&ocirc; xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n 2 ng&agrave;y, th&igrave; kh&ocirc;ng n&ecirc;n ch\\u1ea7n ch\\u1edd \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g&igrave; n\\u1eefa. Ngay l&uacute;c n&agrave;y, anh em n&ecirc;n \\u0111&aacute;nh con l&ocirc; \\u0111&oacute; v&agrave;o ng&agrave;y k\\u1ebf ti\\u1ebfp nh\\u1eb1m n&acirc;ng cao c\\u01a1 h\\u1ed9i chi\\u1ebfn th\\u1eafng.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt; color: #008000;\\\">B\\u1eaft l&ocirc; gan<\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>L&ocirc; gan \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ebfn l&agrave; nh\\u1eefng con l&ocirc; \\u0111&atilde; l&acirc;u l\\u1eafm r\\u1ed3i ch\\u01b0a n\\u1ed5. Th\\u01b0\\u1eddng l\\u1ec7, sau t\\u1ea7m 1 tu\\u1ea7n, anh em th\\u1ea5y con l&ocirc; n&agrave;o ch\\u01b0a xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n. V\\u1eady th&igrave;, anh em h&atilde;y nu&ocirc;i con l&ocirc; \\u0111&oacute; trong kho\\u1ea3ng th\\u1eddi gian 3 ng&agrave;y li&ecirc;n ti\\u1ebfp.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c bi\\u1ebft, t\\u1ef7 l\\u1ec7 n\\u1ed5 c\\u1ee7a nh\\u1eefng con l&ocirc; gan 7 ng&agrave;y ch\\u01b0a xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n s\\u1ebd c\\u1ef1c k\\u1ef3 l\\u1edbn.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt; color: #008000;\\\">B\\u1eaft l&ocirc; 3 l\\u1ea7n g\\u1ea7n nh\\u1ea5t kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; l&ocirc; r\\u01a1i<\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi c&aacute;ch soi c\\u1ea7u n&agrave;y, anh em c\\u1ea7n ti\\u1ebfn h&agrave;nh th\\u1ed1ng k&ecirc; 3 l\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u1ec1 n\\u1ed5 ra g\\u1ea7n \\u0111&acirc;y nh\\u1ea5t. Trong tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p, anh em kh&ocirc;ng th\\u1ea5t l&ocirc; r\\u01a1i th&igrave; n&ecirc;n \\u0111&aacute;nh con l&ocirc; \\u0111&oacute;.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>T\\u1ea7m kho\\u1ea3ng 1 \\u0111\\u1ebfn 3 ng&agrave;y sau, l&ocirc; r\\u01a1i s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c n\\u1ed5 ra. \\u0110&acirc;y s\\u1ebd l&agrave; m\\u1ed9t c&aacute;ch soi c\\u1ea7u mang \\u0111\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u1ed9 chu\\u1ea9n x&aacute;c l&ecirc;n \\u0111\\u1ebfn m\\u1ee9c l&agrave; 80%.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt; color: #008000;\\\">Soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n B\\u1eafc theo ki\\u1ec3u l&ocirc; k&eacute;p<\\/span><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Theo th&ocirc;ng tin t&igrave;m hi\\u1ec3u, soi c\\u1ea7u l&ocirc; k&eacute;p c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd l&agrave; m\\u1ed9t c&aacute;ch soi c\\u1ea7u mang \\u0111\\u1ebfn hi\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3 cao. Ch&uacute;ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c nhi\\u1ec1u anh em v\\u1eadn d\\u1ee5ng v&agrave; mang v\\u1ec1 chi\\u1ebfn th\\u1eafng:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt; color: #008000;\\\">&Aacute;p d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ph&aacute;p \\u0111\\u1ea7u c&acirc;m \\u0111&iacute;t c&acirc;m<\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>V\\u1eadn d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ph&aacute;p \\u0111\\u1ea7u c&acirc;m hay \\u0111&iacute;t c&acirc;m, \\u0111\\u1ed3i h\\u1ecfi anh em ph\\u1ea3i th\\u1ed1ng k&ecirc; xem th\\u1eed h&ocirc;m nay c&oacute; con s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ea7m c&acirc;u hay \\u0111&iacute;t c&acirc;m n&agrave;o kh&ocirc;ng. V&agrave; r\\u1ed3i, ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u01a1i c\\u1ea7n ch&uacute; &yacute; xem 3 ng&agrave;y k\\u1ebf ti\\u1ebfp c&oacute; s\\u1ef1 xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n l&ocirc; k&eacute;o c\\u1ee7a con l&ocirc; \\u0111&oacute; kh&ocirc;ng.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Trong tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p c&oacute; th&igrave; d\\u1eebng, n\\u1ebfu nh\\u01b0 kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; th&igrave; anh em n&ecirc;n nu&ocirc;i ch&uacute;ng v&agrave;o 3 ng&agrave;y ti\\u1ebfp theo. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u n&agrave;y s\\u1ebd t\\u0103ng c\\u01a1 h\\u1ed9i mang v\\u1ec1 chi\\u1ebfn th\\u1eafng.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Th&iacute; d\\u1ee5 nh\\u01b0, v&agrave;o ng&agrave;y ch\\u1ee7 nh\\u1eadt \\u0111\\u1ec1u c&oacute; 7 c&acirc;m. V\\u1eady th&igrave;, trong 3 ng&agrave;y k\\u1ebf ti\\u1ebfp theo ngay con s\\u1ed1 77 ch\\u01b0a n\\u1ed5, \\u0111\\u1ebfn ng&agrave;y th\\u1ee9 4 \\u0111&aacute;nh ngay con 77. Anh em c\\u1ea7n nu&ocirc;i con l&ocirc; 77 n&agrave;y t\\u1eeb 1 \\u0111\\u1ebfn 3 ng&agrave;y, c&oacute; nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady m\\u1edbi t\\u0103ng c\\u01a1 h\\u1ed9i chi\\u1ebfn th\\u1eafng.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt; color: #008000;\\\">Soi l&ocirc; k&eacute;p theo gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t<\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi c&aacute;ch soi c\\u1ea7u n&agrave;y, ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u01a1i c\\u1ea7n ti\\u1ebfn h&agrave;nh theo d&otilde;i k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 c\\u1ee7a gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t. Trong tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p, anh em nh\\u1eadn th\\u1ea5y gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t n\\u1ed5 l&ocirc; k&eacute;o th&igrave; h&atilde;y ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c nu&ocirc;i ch&uacute;ng trong 3 ng&agrave;y k\\u1ebf ti\\u1ebfp.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>N\\u1ebfu nh\\u01b0, con l&ocirc; k&eacute;p xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n \\u1edf gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t th&igrave; c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 \\u1edf b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 v\\u1ecb tr&iacute; n&agrave;o. Mi\\u1ec5n sao, anh em \\u0111&aacute;nh 2 s\\u1ed1 c\\u1ea1nh nhau.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Nhi\\u1ec1u anh em th\\u01b0\\u1eddng nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u1ecbnh r\\u1eb1ng, l&ocirc; k&eacute;o ph\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n \\u1edf 2 s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti&ecirc;n ho\\u1eb7c cu\\u1ed1i c&ugrave;ng. \\u0110&acirc;y l&agrave; m\\u1ed9t nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u1ecbnh kh&ocirc;ng h\\u1ec1 chu\\u1ea9n x&aacute;c.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Th&iacute; d\\u1ee5 nh\\u01b0, gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t h&ocirc;m nay v\\u1ec1 93351. \\u0110&acirc;y s\\u1ebd l&agrave; con s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n l&ocirc; k&eacute;p l&agrave; 55. Anh em c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 nu&ocirc;i con l&ocirc; 55 n&agrave;y trong 3 ng&agrave;y k\\u1ebf ti\\u1ebfp. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u n&agrave;y s\\u1ebd t\\u0103ng c\\u01a1 h\\u1ed9i chi\\u1ebfn th\\u1eafng l&ecirc;n \\u0111\\u1ebfn con s\\u1ed1 l&agrave; 80%.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt; color: #008000;\\\">Soi l&ocirc; k&eacute;p c\\u1ee7a gi\\u1ea3i 7<\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u01a1i h&atilde;y theo d&otilde;i k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 c\\u1ee7a gi\\u1ea3i 7. Trong tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p, nh\\u1eefng con l&ocirc; c\\u1ee7a gi\\u1ea3i 7 c&oacute; con s\\u1ed1 \\u0111u&ocirc;i tr&ugrave;ng kh\\u1edbp v\\u1edbi s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ea7u th&igrave; kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng v\\u1ec1 con l&ocirc; k&eacute;p c\\u1ee7a ng&agrave;y k\\u1ebf ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1ef1c k\\u1ef3 l\\u1edbn.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Th&iacute; d\\u1ee5 nh\\u01b0, ng&agrave;y h&ocirc;m nay gi\\u1ea3i 7 v\\u1ec1 con l&ocirc; s\\u1ed1: 32 25 15 67. L&uacute;c n&agrave;y c&oacute; 2 s\\u1ed1 tr&ugrave;ng kh\\u1edbp v\\u1edbi nhau. V&agrave;o ng&agrave;y h&ocirc;m sau, anh em h&atilde;y ti\\u1ebfn h&agrave;nh \\u0111&aacute;nh con l&ocirc; 22. Ch\\u1eafc ch\\u1eafn, c\\u01a1 h\\u1ed9i mang v\\u1ec1 chi\\u1ebfn th\\u1eafng c\\u1ef1c l\\u1edbn.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2><span style=\\\"font-size: 18pt; color: #008000;\\\">K\\u1ebft b&agrave;i<\\/span><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady, n\\u1ed9i dung b&agrave;i vi\\u1ebft tr&ecirc;n <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/soicaumb247.com\\/\\\">soi c\\u1ea7u 247<\\/a> \\u0111&atilde; h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn anh em th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec1n B\\u1eafc m\\u1ed9t c&aacute;ch chi ti\\u1ebft nh\\u1ea5t. Hy v\\u1ecdng r\\u1eb1ng, anh em s\\u1ebd v\\u1eadn d\\u1ee5ng d\\u1ec5 d&agrave;ng. Trong tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p, anh em c\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u1ecba ch\\u1ec9 soi c\\u1ea7u mi\\u1ec5n ph&iacute; th&igrave;: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/soicaumb247.com\\/\\\">https:\\/\\/soicaumb247.com\\/<\\/a> l&agrave; m\\u1ed9t g\\u1ee3i &yacute; kh&oacute; l&ograve;ng b\\u1ecf l\\u1ee1.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"_token\":\"bfbw7VlZxTs7LM4G05cGufjSNVrxVQrzPkj6uUFL\",\"_method\":\"PUT\",\"_previous_\":\"https:\\/\\/admcpwinspro.nuoilo66.com\\/admin\\/category\"}', '2025-10-05 18:16:30', '2025-10-05 18:16:30'),
