\\u00e1c\",\"content\":\"{\\\"soicau\\\":\\\"<div class=\\\\\\\"list1\\\\\\\">\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<center><br><span style=\\\\\\\"color: #008000; font-size: 22px;\\\\\\\"><strong> N\\\\u1ed9i Quy v\\u00e0 \\\\u0110i\\\\u1ec1u Kho\\\\u1ea3n <\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span><br><img class=\\\\\\\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15301\\\\\\\" src=\\\\\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/soicaumb247.com\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2022\\\\\\/11\\\\\\/gach_title.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"N\\\\u1ed9i quy v\\u00e0 \\\\u0110i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n\\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\\"295\\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\\"34\\\\\\\" loading=\\\\\\\"lazy\\\\\\\"><\\\\\\/center>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\"text-align: justify;\\\\\\\">Ch\\u00e0o m\\\\u1eebng b\\\\u1ea1n \\\\u0111\\\\u1ebfn v\\\\u1edbi website Soicaumb247.Com c\\\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i. Sau \\\\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\\\u1eefng \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n khi b\\\\u1ea1n s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng d\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 tr\\u00ean <a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/soicaumb247.com\\\\\\/\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\"color: #0000ff;\\\\\\\">Soi c\\\\u1ea7u 247<\\\\\\/span><\\\\\\/a> c\\\\u0169ng nh\\\\u01b0 c\\u00e1c quy \\\\u0111\\\\u1ecbnh n\\\\u1ed9i dung, b\\\\u1ea3n quy\\\\u1ec1n, quy \\\\u0111\\\\u1ecbnh v\\\\u1ec1 n\\\\u1ed9i dung \\\\u0111\\\\u0103ng t\\\\u1ea3i. C\\u00e1c h\\u00e0nh vi vi ph\\\\u1ea1m ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt b\\\\u1ecb c\\\\u1ea5m.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<center>\\\\u0110i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng<\\\\\\/center>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Vi\\\\u1ec7c hi\\\\u1ec3u r\\u00f5 c\\u00e1c \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n n\\u00e0y r\\\\u1ea5t quan tr\\\\u1ecdng v\\u00ec b\\\\u1eb1ng vi\\\\u1ec7c s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng d\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 c\\\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i, b\\\\u1ea1n \\\\u0111ang \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed3ng \\u00fd v\\\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n n\\u00e0y. Ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i mong b\\\\u1ea1n vui l\\u00f2ng d\\u00e0nh th\\\\u1eddi gian \\\\u0111\\\\u1ecdc v\\u00e0 t\\u00ecm hi\\\\u1ec3u v\\\\u1ec1 c\\u00e1c \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng n\\u00e0y.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>D\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 c\\\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i r\\\\u1ea5t \\\\u0111a d\\\\u1ea1ng n\\u00ean c\\u00f3 th\\\\u1ec3 \\u00e1p d\\\\u1ee5ng m\\\\u1ed9t s\\\\u1ed1 \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n b\\\\u1ed5 sung ho\\\\u1eb7c c\\u00e1c y\\u00eau c\\\\u1ea7u v\\\\u1ec1 s\\\\u1ea3n ph\\\\u1ea9m (bao g\\\\u1ed3m y\\u00eau c\\\\u1ea7u v\\\\u1ec1 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9 tu\\\\u1ed5i). C\\u00e1c \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n b\\\\u1ed5 sung s\\\\u1ebd \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1ee3c cung c\\\\u1ea5p k\\u00e8m theo D\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 li\\u00ean quan b\\\\u1ed5 sung v\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n b\\\\u1ed5 sung \\\\u0111\\u00f3 s\\\\u1ebd tr\\\\u1edf th\\u00e0nh m\\\\u1ed9t ph\\\\u1ea7n thu\\\\u1ed9c th\\\\u1ecfa thu\\\\u1eadn c\\\\u1ee7a b\\\\u1ea1n v\\\\u1edbi ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i n\\\\u1ebfu b\\\\u1ea1n s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng c\\u00e1c d\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 \\\\u0111\\u00f3.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<center>Quy \\\\u0111\\\\u1ecbnh v\\u00e0 \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n<\\\\\\/center>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>1.<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> Kh\\u00f4ng khuy\\\\u1ebfn kh\\u00edch \\u00e9p bu\\\\u1ed9c ch\\u00e8o k\\u00e9o tham gia s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng d\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 tr\\u00ean websitle.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>2.<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> Kh\\u00f4ng ch\\\\u1ecbu b\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ee9 m\\\\u1ed9t tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m v\\\\u1ec1 t\\\\u1ed5n th\\\\u1ea5t thi\\\\u1ec7t h\\\\u1ea1i v\\\\u1eadt ch\\\\u1ea5t hay tinh th\\u00e2n n\\u00e0o v\\\\u1ec1 vi\\\\u1ec7c s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng c\\u00e1c th\\u00f4ng tin tr\\u00ean web.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>3.<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> Kh\\u00f4ng ch\\\\u1ecbu b\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ee9 tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m n\\u00e0o tr\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt v\\\\u1edbi nh\\\\u1eefng th\\u00f4ng tin \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0a ra v\\u00ec \\\\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\\\u1ec9 l\\u00e0 tham kh\\\\u1ea3o cho ng\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng t\\u00f9y \\u00fd l\\\\u1ef1a ch\\\\u1ecdn.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>4.<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> Kh\\u00f4ng soi l\\u00f4 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1 b\\u00e1n s\\\\u1ed1 l\\u00f4 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1 , c\\u00e1c c\\\\u01b0\\\\u1ee3c v\\u00e0 c\\u00e1 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9 l\\u00f4 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1 tr\\u00e1i ph\\u00e9p , kh\\u00f4ng cung c\\\\u1ea5p s\\\\u1ed1 ch\\\\u01a1i l\\u00f4 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>5.<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> Ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i kh\\u00f4ng ch\\\\u1ecbu tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m v\\\\u1ec1 vi\\\\u1ec7c s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng th\\u00f4ng tin v\\u00e0o m\\\\u1ee5c \\\\u0111\\u00edch c\\u00e1 nh\\u00e2n c\\\\u1ee7a b\\\\u1ea1n.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<center>Mi\\\\u1ec5n Tr\\\\u1eeb Tr\\u00e1ch Nhi\\\\u1ec7m<\\\\\\/center>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>\\\\u2043<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> T\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ea3 th\\u00f4ng tin m\\u00e0 tr\\u00ean website soicaumb247.com ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i cung c\\\\u1ea5p ch\\\\u1ec9 mang t\\u00ednh ch\\\\u1ea5t tham kh\\\\u1ea3o, xin m\\\\u1ecdi ng\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddi ch\\u00fa \\u00fd tu\\u00e2n th\\\\u1ee7 ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt c\\\\u1ee7a n\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc s\\\\u1edf t\\\\u1ea1i, kh\\u00f4ng \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1ee3c ph\\u00e9p s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng th\\u00f4ng tin c\\\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec3 ti\\\\u1ebfn h\\u00e0nh ho\\\\u1ea1t \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9ng phi ph\\u00e1p. N\\\\u1ebfu kh\\u00f4ng, qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch s\\\\u1ebd ph\\\\u1ea3i ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n ch\\\\u1ecbu tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m tr\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt. Web ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng ch\\\\u1ecbu b\\\\u1ea5t k\\u00ec tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m n\\u00e0o.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>\\\\u2043<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> C\\u00e1c th\\u00f4ng tin soicaumb247.com cung c\\\\u1ea5p, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i c\\\\u1ed1 g\\\\u1eafng c\\\\u1eadp nh\\\\u1eadt th\\u00f4ng tin D\\\\u1ef1 \\\\u0110o\\u00e1n K\\\\u1ebft Qu\\\\u1ea3 X\\\\u1ed5 S\\\\u1ed1 Ki\\\\u1ebfn Thi\\\\u1ebft Nh\\u00e0 N\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc, nh\\\\u01b0ng kh\\u00f4ng b\\\\u1ea3o \\\\u0111\\\\u1ea3m \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1ee3c hoa\\\\u0300n toa\\\\u0300n chi\\\\u0301nh xa\\\\u0301c. Th\\u00f4ng tin cung c\\\\u1ea5p ch\\\\u1ec9 cho tham kh\\\\u1ea3o, n\\\\u1ebfu th\\u00f4ng tin D\\\\u1ef1 \\\\u0110o\\u00e1n KQXSKT tr\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc gi\\\\u1edd quay kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u00ednh x\\u00e1c g\\u00e2y ra b\\\\u1ea5t k\\u00ec t\\\\u1ed5n th\\\\u1ea5t n\\u00e0o cho m\\\\u1ecdi ng\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddi, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng ch\\\\u1ecbu tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>\\\\u2043<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> T\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ea3 qu\\\\u1ea3ng ca\\\\u0301o tr\\u00ean web ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i, \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1u la\\\\u0300 y\\\\u0301 ki\\\\u1ebfn ca\\\\u0301 nh\\u00e2n c\\\\u1ee7a kha\\\\u0301ch ha\\\\u0300ng, kh\\u00f4ng li\\u00ean quan g\\u00ec v\\\\u1edbi web ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>\\\\u2043<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> T\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ea3 \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddng link qu\\\\u1ea3ng c\\u00e1o tr\\u00ean web ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i, b\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ee9 h\\u00ecnh th\\\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0o, mi\\\\u1ec5n ph\\u00ed, thu ph\\u00ed, ho\\\\u1eb7c c\\u00f4ng \\u00edch, \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1u ph\\\\u1ea3i tu\\u00e2n theo ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt quy \\\\u0111\\\\u1ecbnh, n\\\\u1ed9i dung kh\\u00f4ng \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1ee3c li\\u00ean quan t\\\\u1edbi nh\\\\u1eefng n\\\\u1ed9i dung c\\u00f3 h\\\\u1ea1i nh\\\\u01b0 vi ph\\\\u1ea1m ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt, ho\\\\u1ea1t \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9ng ph\\\\u1ea3n \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9ng, m\\u00ea t\\u00edn, m\\\\u1ea1i d\\u00e2m, v.v<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>\\\\u2043<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> N\\\\u1ebfu vi ph\\\\u1ea1m, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i c\\u00f3 quy\\\\u1ec1n x\\u00f3a b\\\\u1ecf \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddng link li\\u00ean quan b\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ee9 khi n\\u00e0o m\\u00e0 l\\\\u1ea1i kh\\u00f4ng ho\\u00e0n l\\\\u1ea1i ph\\u00ed, \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed3ng th\\\\u1eddi c\\u00f3 quy\\\\u1ec1n l\\\\u1ee3i v\\u00e0 ngh\\\\u0129a v\\\\u1ee5 c\\u00f9ng c\\u00e1c b\\\\u1ed9 li\\u00ean quan h\\\\u1ee3p t\\u00e1c truy c\\\\u1ee9u.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/div>\\\",\\\"text_run\\\":\\\"<div class=\\\\\\\"marquee-text\\\\\\\">\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0<img src=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/vietnam.gif\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"l\\u00e1 c\\\\u1edd vi\\\\u1ec7t nam\\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\\"36\\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\\"25\\\\\\\"> \\u00a0 \\u00a0 <span style=\\\\\\\"font-size: 18px; color: #ee0000;\\\\\\\"> SoiCauMB247.Net <\\\\\\/span>\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 <img src=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/bonghoa.gif\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"b\\u00f4ng hoa\\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\\"14\\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\\"12\\\\\\\"> \\u00a0 \\u00a0 <span style=\\\\\\\"color: #009933;\\\\\\\">Trang Di\\\\u1ec5n \\\\u0111\\u00e0n th\\\\u1ea3o lu\\\\u1eadn x\\\\u1ed5 s\\\\u1ed1 soi c\\\\u1ea7u TOP 1 Vi\\\\u1ec7t Nam <\\\\\\/span> \\u00a0 \\u00a0 <img src=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/vietnam_1.gif\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"l\\u00e1 c\\\\u1edd vi\\\\u1ec7t nam\\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\\"36\\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\\"25\\\\\\\"> \\u00a0 \\u00a0<\\\\\\/div>\\\"}\",\"soicau\":\"<div class=\\\"list1\\\">\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<center><br><span style=\\\"color: #008000; font-size: 22px;\\\"><strong> N\\u1ed9i Quy v&agrave; \\u0110i\\u1ec1u Kho\\u1ea3n <\\/strong><\\/span><br><img class=\\\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15301\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/soicaumb247.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/11\\/gach_title.png\\\" alt=\\\"N\\u1ed9i quy v&agrave; \\u0110i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n\\\" width=\\\"295\\\" height=\\\"34\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"><\\/center>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">Ch&agrave;o m\\u1eebng b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi website Soicaumb247.Com c\\u1ee7a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i. Sau \\u0111&acirc;y l&agrave; nh\\u1eefng \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n khi b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 tr&ecirc;n <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/soicaumb247.com\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #0000ff;\\\">Soi c\\u1ea7u 247<\\/span><\\/a> c\\u0169ng nh\\u01b0 c&aacute;c quy \\u0111\\u1ecbnh n\\u1ed9i dung, b\\u1ea3n quy\\u1ec1n, quy \\u0111\\u1ecbnh v\\u1ec1 n\\u1ed9i dung \\u0111\\u0103ng t\\u1ea3i. C&aacute;c h&agrave;nh vi vi ph\\u1ea1m ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt b\\u1ecb c\\u1ea5m.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<center>\\u0110i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng<\\/center>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Vi\\u1ec7c hi\\u1ec3u r&otilde; c&aacute;c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n n&agrave;y r\\u1ea5t quan tr\\u1ecdng v&igrave; b\\u1eb1ng vi\\u1ec7c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 c\\u1ee7a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i, b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang \\u0111\\u1ed3ng &yacute; v\\u1edbi c&aacute;c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n n&agrave;y. Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i mong b\\u1ea1n vui l&ograve;ng d&agrave;nh th\\u1eddi gian \\u0111\\u1ecdc v&agrave; t&igrave;m hi\\u1ec3u v\\u1ec1 c&aacute;c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng n&agrave;y.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 c\\u1ee7a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i r\\u1ea5t \\u0111a d\\u1ea1ng n&ecirc;n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 &aacute;p d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n b\\u1ed5 sung ho\\u1eb7c c&aacute;c y&ecirc;u c\\u1ea7u v\\u1ec1 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m (bao g\\u1ed3m y&ecirc;u c\\u1ea7u v\\u1ec1 \\u0111\\u1ed9 tu\\u1ed5i). C&aacute;c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n b\\u1ed5 sung s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c cung c\\u1ea5p k&egrave;m theo D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 li&ecirc;n quan b\\u1ed5 sung v&agrave; c&aacute;c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n b\\u1ed5 sung \\u0111&oacute; s\\u1ebd tr\\u1edf th&agrave;nh m\\u1ed9t ph\\u1ea7n thu\\u1ed9c th\\u1ecfa thu\\u1eadn c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n v\\u1edbi ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c&aacute;c d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 \\u0111&oacute;.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<center>Quy \\u0111\\u1ecbnh v&agrave; \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kho\\u1ea3n<\\/center>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><strong>1.<\\/strong><\\/span> Kh&ocirc;ng khuy\\u1ebfn kh&iacute;ch &eacute;p bu\\u1ed9c ch&egrave;o k&eacute;o tham gia s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 tr&ecirc;n websitle.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><strong>2.<\\/strong><\\/span> Kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ecbu b\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee9 m\\u1ed9t tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m v\\u1ec1 t\\u1ed5n th\\u1ea5t thi\\u1ec7t h\\u1ea1i v\\u1eadt ch\\u1ea5t hay tinh th&acirc;n n&agrave;o v\\u1ec1 vi\\u1ec7c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin tr&ecirc;n web.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><strong>3.<\\/strong><\\/span> Kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ecbu b\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee9 tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m n&agrave;o tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng th&ocirc;ng tin \\u0111\\u01b0a ra v&igrave; \\u0111&acirc;y ch\\u1ec9 l&agrave; tham kh\\u1ea3o cho ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d&ugrave;ng t&ugrave;y &yacute; l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><strong>4.<\\/strong><\\/span> Kh&ocirc;ng soi l&ocirc; \\u0111\\u1ec1 b&aacute;n s\\u1ed1 l&ocirc; \\u0111\\u1ec1 , c&aacute;c c\\u01b0\\u1ee3c v&agrave; c&aacute; \\u0111\\u1ed9 l&ocirc; \\u0111\\u1ec1 tr&aacute;i ph&eacute;p , kh&ocirc;ng cung c\\u1ea5p s\\u1ed1 ch\\u01a1i l&ocirc; \\u0111\\u1ec1.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><strong>5.<\\/strong><\\/span> Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ecbu tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m v\\u1ec1 vi\\u1ec7c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng th&ocirc;ng tin v&agrave;o m\\u1ee5c \\u0111&iacute;ch c&aacute; nh&acirc;n c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<center>Mi\\u1ec5n Tr\\u1eeb Tr&aacute;ch Nhi\\u1ec7m<\\/center>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><strong>\\u2043<\\/strong><\\/span> T\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 th&ocirc;ng tin m&agrave; tr&ecirc;n website soicaumb247.com ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i cung c\\u1ea5p ch\\u1ec9 mang t&iacute;nh ch\\u1ea5t tham kh\\u1ea3o, xin m\\u1ecdi ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch&uacute; &yacute; tu&acirc;n th\\u1ee7 ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt c\\u1ee7a n\\u01b0\\u1edbc s\\u1edf t\\u1ea1i, kh&ocirc;ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ph&eacute;p s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng th&ocirc;ng tin c\\u1ee7a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i \\u0111\\u1ec3 ti\\u1ebfn h&agrave;nh ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng phi ph&aacute;p. N\\u1ebfu kh&ocirc;ng, qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch s\\u1ebd ph\\u1ea3i ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n ch\\u1ecbu tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt. Web ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s\\u1ebd kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ecbu b\\u1ea5t k&igrave; tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m n&agrave;o.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><strong>\\u2043<\\/strong><\\/span> C&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin soicaumb247.com cung c\\u1ea5p, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c\\u1ed1 g\\u1eafng c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt th&ocirc;ng tin D\\u1ef1 \\u0110o&aacute;n K\\u1ebft Qu\\u1ea3 X\\u1ed5 S\\u1ed1 Ki\\u1ebfn Thi\\u1ebft Nh&agrave; N\\u01b0\\u1edbc, nh\\u01b0ng kh&ocirc;ng b\\u1ea3o \\u0111\\u1ea3m \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c hoa\\u0300n toa\\u0300n chi\\u0301nh xa\\u0301c. Th&ocirc;ng tin cung c\\u1ea5p ch\\u1ec9 cho tham kh\\u1ea3o, n\\u1ebfu th&ocirc;ng tin D\\u1ef1 \\u0110o&aacute;n KQXSKT tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc gi\\u1edd quay kh&ocirc;ng ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c g&acirc;y ra b\\u1ea5t k&igrave; t\\u1ed5n th\\u1ea5t n&agrave;o cho m\\u1ecdi ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s\\u1ebd kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ecbu tr&aacute;ch nhi\\u1ec7m.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><strong>\\u2043<\\/strong><\\/span> T\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 qu\\u1ea3ng ca\\u0301o tr&ecirc;n web ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i, \\u0111\\u1ec1u la\\u0300 y\\u0301 ki\\u1ebfn ca\\u0301 nh&acirc;n c\\u1ee7a kha\\u0301ch ha\\u0300ng, kh&ocirc;ng li&ecirc;n quan g&igrave; v\\u1edbi web ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><strong>\\u2043<\\/strong><\\/span> T\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng link qu\\u1ea3ng c&aacute;o tr&ecirc;n web ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i, b\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee9 h&igrave;nh th\\u1ee9c n&agrave;o, mi\\u1ec5n ph&iacute;, thu ph&iacute;, ho\\u1eb7c c&ocirc;ng &iacute;ch, \\u0111\\u1ec1u ph\\u1ea3i tu&acirc;n theo ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt quy \\u0111\\u1ecbnh, n\\u1ed9i dung kh&ocirc;ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c li&ecirc;n quan t\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng n\\u1ed9i dung c&oacute; h\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 vi ph\\u1ea1m ph&aacute;p lu\\u1eadt, ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ph\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ed9ng, m&ecirc; t&iacute;n, m\\u1ea1i d&acirc;m, v.v<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: red;\\\"><strong>\\u2043<\\/strong><\\/span> N\\u1ebfu vi ph\\u1ea1m, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c&oacute; quy\\u1ec1n x&oacute;a b\\u1ecf \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng link li&ecirc;n quan b\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee9 khi n&agrave;o m&agrave; l\\u1ea1i kh&ocirc;ng ho&agrave;n l\\u1ea1i ph&iacute;, \\u0111\\u1ed3ng th\\u1eddi c&oacute; quy\\u1ec1n l\\u1ee3i v&agrave; ngh\\u0129a v\\u1ee5 c&ugrave;ng c&aacute;c b\\u1ed9 li&ecirc;n quan h\\u1ee3p t&aacute;c truy c\\u1ee9u.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"text_run\":\"<div class=\\\"marquee-text\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\\\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/vietnam.gif\\\" alt=\\\"l&aacute; c\\u1edd vi\\u1ec7t nam\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"25\\\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\\\"font-size: 18px; color: #ee0000;\\\"> SoiCauMB247.Net <\\/span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\\\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/bonghoa.gif\\\" alt=\\\"b&ocirc;ng hoa\\\" width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"12\\\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\\\"color: #009933;\\\">Trang Di\\u1ec5n \\u0111&agrave;n th\\u1ea3o lu\\u1eadn x\\u1ed5 s\\u1ed1 soi c\\u1ea7u TOP 1 Vi\\u1ec7t Nam <\\/span> &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\\\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/vietnam_1.gif\\\" alt=\\\"l&aacute; c\\u1edd vi\\u1ec7t nam\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"25\\\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<\\/div>\",\"_token\":\"iXNRDJtybanP8L8VrzGzDFeqrxEHxFqAUbP7KzHa\",\"_method\":\"PUT\"}', '2025-11-11 00:03:59', '2025-11-11 00:03:59'),
