(1357, 1, 'admin/settings/1', 'PUT', '27.72.145.149', '{\"name\":\"tajsc\",\"address\":\"17 - 19, Ng\\u00f5 59 L\\u00e1ng H\\u1ea1, Qu\\u1eadn Ba \\u0110\\u00ecnh, H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i\",\"phone\":\"0912888999\",\"telegram\":\"@nuoilo66\",\"email\":\"nuoilo66@gmail.com\",\"soicau\":\"<p class=\\\"banner_text\\\">C&ocirc;ng ty C\\u1ed5 ph\\u1ea7n C&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 HealthChain (HealthChain Jsc.) th&agrave;nh l\\u1eadp n\\u0103m 2023, v\\u1edbi m\\u1ee5c ti&ecirc;u cung c\\u1ea5p d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 v&agrave; gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i s\\u1ed1 chuy&ecirc;n s&acirc;u trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c y t\\u1ebf cho kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng trong v&agrave; ngo&agrave;i n\\u01b0\\u1edbc. <br><br>Th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n s&aacute;ng l\\u1eadp c\\u1ee7a HealthChain l&agrave; c&aacute;c chuy&ecirc;n gia c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 gi&agrave;u kinh nghi\\u1ec7m, \\u0111&atilde; nhi\\u1ec1u n\\u0103m t\\u1eadn t\\u1ee5y v&agrave; \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h&agrave;nh v\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n c\\u1ee7a \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 th&ocirc;ng tin ng&agrave;nh y t\\u1ebf. V\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1ed9i ng\\u0169 k\\u1ef9 s\\u01b0 tr\\u1ebb c&oacute; n\\u0103ng l\\u1ef1c, kh&aacute;t khao v&agrave; \\u0111am m&ecirc; s&aacute;ng t\\u1ea1o, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i ch&uacute; tr\\u1ecdng \\u0111\\u1eb7t m&igrave;nh v&agrave;o v\\u1ecb tr&iacute; c\\u1ee7a ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d&ugrave;ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u1ea1o ra nh\\u1eefng s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i v\\u1edbi phong c&aacute;ch l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p nh\\u1ea5t. Trong th\\u1eddi gian t\\u1edbi, HealthChain s\\u1ebd ti&ecirc;n phong ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n c&aacute;c gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i s\\u1ed1 y t\\u1ebf chuy&ecirc;n s&acirc;u v\\u1edbi m\\u1ee5c ti&ecirc;u &ldquo;\\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n nh\\u01b0ng hi\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3&rdquo;. Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i cam k\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h&agrave;nh l&acirc;u d&agrave;i v\\u1edbi kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 c&ugrave;ng ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n, s&aacute;ng t\\u1ea1o, \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng hi\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3 c&aacute;c n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng s\\u1ed1 y t\\u1ebf v\\u1edbi chi ph&iacute; t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u nh\\u1ea5t.<\\/p>\",\"text1\":\"<ul>\\r\\n<li>L\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ec1 &aacute;n, k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i s\\u1ed1 y t\\u1ebf v&agrave; tri\\u1ec3n khai y t\\u1ebf th&ocirc;ng minh<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng kho c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; h\\u1ed3 s\\u01a1 s\\u1ee9c kh\\u1ecfe \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed c\\u1ea5p t\\u1ec9nh<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p s\\u1ed1 h&oacute;a v&agrave; qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; b\\u1ec7nh &aacute;n \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed t\\u1eadp trung ng&agrave;nh y t\\u1ebf<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p cung c\\u1ea5p d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u m\\u1edf chuy&ecirc;n ng&agrave;nh y t\\u1ebf<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\u0110&agrave;o t\\u1ea1o, n&acirc;ng cao n\\u0103ng l\\u1ef1c chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i s\\u1ed1 l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c y t\\u1ebf<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"text2\":\"<ul class=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n<li>Ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;m, k&ecirc; \\u0111\\u01a1n \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m \\u0111\\u1eb7t h\\u1eb9n kh&aacute;m tr\\u1ef1c tuy\\u1ebfn<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; kh&aacute;m s\\u1ee9c kh\\u1ecfe; h\\u1ed3 s\\u01a1 s\\u1ee9c kh\\u1ecfe \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m v&agrave; c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u chuy&ecirc;n ng&agrave;nh y t\\u1ebf (D\\u01b0\\u1ee3c, Ki\\u1ec3m nghi\\u1ec7m, An to&agrave;n th\\u1ef1c ph\\u1ea9m, Gi&aacute;m \\u0111\\u1ecbnh y khoa, Gi&aacute;m \\u0111\\u1ecbnh ph&aacute;p y&hellip;)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m trung t&acirc;m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u h&agrave;nh y t\\u1ebf th&ocirc;ng minh<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"texttag\":\"<ul>\\r\\n<li>Gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p t&iacute;ch h\\u1ee3p d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u ng&agrave;nh y t\\u1ebf<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf, x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng website chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p cho c\\u01a1 quan, t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c, doanh nghi\\u1ec7p<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n, gia c&ocirc;ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m chuy&ecirc;n bi\\u1ec7t l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c y t\\u1ebf<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 b\\u1ea3o tr&igrave;, h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 v\\u1eadn h&agrave;nh h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng th&ocirc;ng tin y t\\u1ebf<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cung c\\u1ea5p thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 th&ocirc;ng tin chuy&ecirc;n d\\u1ee5ng trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c y t\\u1ebf<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"copyright\":\"<div class=\\\"col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-8\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"tscct_txt\\\">V\\u1edbi nhi\\u1ec1u n\\u0103m kinh nghi\\u1ec7m th\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec5n, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i th\\u1ea5u hi\\u1ec3u t\\u1ea7m quan tr\\u1ecdng c\\u1ee7a vi\\u1ec7c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c&aacute;c n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 s\\u1ed1 trong chu\\u1ed7i gi&aacute; tr\\u1ecb d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 c\\u1ee7a qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch.<br>HealthChain cam k\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h&agrave;nh b\\u1eb1ng s\\u1ef1 \\u0111\\u1ea3m b\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec1 d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 b\\u1ea3o tr&igrave;, h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 24\\/7 t\\u1edbi m\\u1ecdi kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng trong su\\u1ed1t th\\u1eddi gian cung c\\u1ea5p d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5, v\\u1edbi quy tr&igrave;nh \\u0111\\u1ea3m b\\u1ea3o th\\u1ef1c thi chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul class=\\\"tscct_lst\\\">\\r\\n<li>Kh\\u1ea3o s&aacute;t, ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn th&ocirc;ng tin c\\u1ee7a kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>K&yacute; cam k\\u1ebft b\\u1ea3o m\\u1eadt th&ocirc;ng tin<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ul class=\\\"tscct_lst\\\">\\r\\n<li>T\\u01b0 v\\u1ea5n, l\\u1eadp k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch tri\\u1ec3n khai d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n c&agrave;i \\u0111\\u1eb7t, hi\\u1ec7u ch\\u1ec9nh h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ul class=\\\"tscct_lst\\\">\\r\\n<li>Th\\u1ed1ng nh\\u1ea5t quy tr&igrave;nh, ph\\u1ea1m vi d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cung c\\u1ea5p d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3, v\\u1eadn h&agrave;nh 24\\/7<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"textfooter\":\"<p class=\\\"f_text\\\">Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i hi\\u1ec3u r&otilde; kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; m\\u1ed9t gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p to&agrave;n di\\u1ec7n n&agrave;o gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c m\\u1ecdi v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1, tuy nhi&ecirc;n lu&ocirc;n t\\u1ed3n t\\u1ea1i m\\u1ed9t l\\u1eddi gi\\u1ea3i t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u cho m\\u1ed9t y&ecirc;u c\\u1ea7u nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5 c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3.<br><br>HealthChain kh&aacute;t khao \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h&agrave;nh v\\u1edbi qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 c&ugrave;ng tham gia gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft t\\u1eebng b&agrave;i to&aacute;n c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3. Chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i nh\\u1eefng kh&aacute;i ni\\u1ec7m tr\\u1eebu t\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng c\\u1ee7a chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i s\\u1ed1 y t\\u1ebf th&agrave;nh nh\\u1eefng c&ocirc;ng c\\u1ee5, ti\\u1ec7n &iacute;ch ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n, d\\u1ec5 ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn v\\u1edbi chi ph&iacute; t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u nh\\u1ea5t.<\\/p>\",\"site_title\":\"tajsc\",\"meta_description\":\"tajsc\",\"content\":\"{\\\"soicau\\\":\\\"<div class=\\\\\\\"list1\\\\\\\">\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<center><br><span style=\\\\\\\"color: #008000; font-size: 22px;\\\\\\\"><strong> N\\\\u1ed9i Quy v\\u00e0 \\\\u0110i\\\\u1ec1u Kho\\\\u1ea3n <\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span><br><img class=\\\\\\\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15301\\\\\\\" src=\\\\\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/soicaumb247.com\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2022\\\\\\/11\\\\\\/gach_title.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"N\\\\u1ed9i quy v\\u00e0 \\\\u0110i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n\\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\\"295\\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\\"34\\\\\\\" loading=\\\\\\\"lazy\\\\\\\"><\\\\\\/center>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\"text-align: justify;\\\\\\\">Ch\\u00e0o m\\\\u1eebng b\\\\u1ea1n \\\\u0111\\\\u1ebfn v\\\\u1edbi website Soicaumb247.Com c\\\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i. Sau \\\\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\\\u1eefng \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n khi b\\\\u1ea1n s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng d\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 tr\\u00ean <a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/soicaumb247.com\\\\\\/\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\"color: #0000ff;\\\\\\\">Soi c\\\\u1ea7u 247<\\\\\\/span><\\\\\\/a> c\\\\u0169ng nh\\\\u01b0 c\\u00e1c quy \\\\u0111\\\\u1ecbnh n\\\\u1ed9i dung, b\\\\u1ea3n quy\\\\u1ec1n, quy \\\\u0111\\\\u1ecbnh v\\\\u1ec1 n\\\\u1ed9i dung \\\\u0111\\\\u0103ng t\\\\u1ea3i. C\\u00e1c h\\u00e0nh vi vi ph\\\\u1ea1m ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt b\\\\u1ecb c\\\\u1ea5m.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<center>\\\\u0110i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng<\\\\\\/center>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Vi\\\\u1ec7c hi\\\\u1ec3u r\\u00f5 c\\u00e1c \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n n\\u00e0y r\\\\u1ea5t quan tr\\\\u1ecdng v\\u00ec b\\\\u1eb1ng vi\\\\u1ec7c s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng d\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 c\\\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i, b\\\\u1ea1n \\\\u0111ang \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed3ng \\u00fd v\\\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n n\\u00e0y. Ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i mong b\\\\u1ea1n vui l\\u00f2ng d\\u00e0nh th\\\\u1eddi gian \\\\u0111\\\\u1ecdc v\\u00e0 t\\u00ecm hi\\\\u1ec3u v\\\\u1ec1 c\\u00e1c \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng n\\u00e0y.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>D\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 c\\\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i r\\\\u1ea5t \\\\u0111a d\\\\u1ea1ng n\\u00ean c\\u00f3 th\\\\u1ec3 \\u00e1p d\\\\u1ee5ng m\\\\u1ed9t s\\\\u1ed1 \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n b\\\\u1ed5 sung ho\\\\u1eb7c c\\u00e1c y\\u00eau c\\\\u1ea7u v\\\\u1ec1 s\\\\u1ea3n ph\\\\u1ea9m (bao g\\\\u1ed3m y\\u00eau c\\\\u1ea7u v\\\\u1ec1 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9 tu\\\\u1ed5i). C\\u00e1c \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n b\\\\u1ed5 sung s\\\\u1ebd \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1ee3c cung c\\\\u1ea5p k\\u00e8m theo D\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 li\\u00ean quan b\\\\u1ed5 sung v\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n b\\\\u1ed5 sung \\\\u0111\\u00f3 s\\\\u1ebd tr\\\\u1edf th\\u00e0nh m\\\\u1ed9t ph\\\\u1ea7n thu\\\\u1ed9c th\\\\u1ecfa thu\\\\u1eadn c\\\\u1ee7a b\\\\u1ea1n v\\\\u1edbi ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i n\\\\u1ebfu b\\\\u1ea1n s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng c\\u00e1c d\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 \\\\u0111\\u00f3.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<center>Quy \\\\u0111\\\\u1ecbnh v\\u00e0 \\\\u0111i\\\\u1ec1u kho\\\\u1ea3n<\\\\\\/center>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>1.<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> Kh\\u00f4ng khuy\\\\u1ebfn kh\\u00edch \\u00e9p bu\\\\u1ed9c ch\\u00e8o k\\u00e9o tham gia s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng d\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 tr\\u00ean websitle.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>2.<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> Kh\\u00f4ng ch\\\\u1ecbu b\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ee9 m\\\\u1ed9t tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m v\\\\u1ec1 t\\\\u1ed5n th\\\\u1ea5t thi\\\\u1ec7t h\\\\u1ea1i v\\\\u1eadt ch\\\\u1ea5t hay tinh th\\u00e2n n\\u00e0o v\\\\u1ec1 vi\\\\u1ec7c s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng c\\u00e1c th\\u00f4ng tin tr\\u00ean web.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>3.<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> Kh\\u00f4ng ch\\\\u1ecbu b\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ee9 tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m n\\u00e0o tr\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt v\\\\u1edbi nh\\\\u1eefng th\\u00f4ng tin \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0a ra v\\u00ec \\\\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\\\u1ec9 l\\u00e0 tham kh\\\\u1ea3o cho ng\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng t\\u00f9y \\u00fd l\\\\u1ef1a ch\\\\u1ecdn.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>4.<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> Kh\\u00f4ng soi l\\u00f4 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1 b\\u00e1n s\\\\u1ed1 l\\u00f4 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1 , c\\u00e1c c\\\\u01b0\\\\u1ee3c v\\u00e0 c\\u00e1 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9 l\\u00f4 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1 tr\\u00e1i ph\\u00e9p , kh\\u00f4ng cung c\\\\u1ea5p s\\\\u1ed1 ch\\\\u01a1i l\\u00f4 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>5.<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> Ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i kh\\u00f4ng ch\\\\u1ecbu tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m v\\\\u1ec1 vi\\\\u1ec7c s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng th\\u00f4ng tin v\\u00e0o m\\\\u1ee5c \\\\u0111\\u00edch c\\u00e1 nh\\u00e2n c\\\\u1ee7a b\\\\u1ea1n.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<center>Mi\\\\u1ec5n Tr\\\\u1eeb Tr\\u00e1ch Nhi\\\\u1ec7m<\\\\\\/center>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>\\\\u2043<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> T\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ea3 th\\u00f4ng tin m\\u00e0 tr\\u00ean website soicaumb247.com ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i cung c\\\\u1ea5p ch\\\\u1ec9 mang t\\u00ednh ch\\\\u1ea5t tham kh\\\\u1ea3o, xin m\\\\u1ecdi ng\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddi ch\\u00fa \\u00fd tu\\u00e2n th\\\\u1ee7 ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt c\\\\u1ee7a n\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc s\\\\u1edf t\\\\u1ea1i, kh\\u00f4ng \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1ee3c ph\\u00e9p s\\\\u1eed d\\\\u1ee5ng th\\u00f4ng tin c\\\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec3 ti\\\\u1ebfn h\\u00e0nh ho\\\\u1ea1t \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9ng phi ph\\u00e1p. N\\\\u1ebfu kh\\u00f4ng, qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch s\\\\u1ebd ph\\\\u1ea3i ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n ch\\\\u1ecbu tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m tr\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt. Web ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng ch\\\\u1ecbu b\\\\u1ea5t k\\u00ec tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m n\\u00e0o.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>\\\\u2043<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> C\\u00e1c th\\u00f4ng tin soicaumb247.com cung c\\\\u1ea5p, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i c\\\\u1ed1 g\\\\u1eafng c\\\\u1eadp nh\\\\u1eadt th\\u00f4ng tin D\\\\u1ef1 \\\\u0110o\\u00e1n K\\\\u1ebft Qu\\\\u1ea3 X\\\\u1ed5 S\\\\u1ed1 Ki\\\\u1ebfn Thi\\\\u1ebft Nh\\u00e0 N\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc, nh\\\\u01b0ng kh\\u00f4ng b\\\\u1ea3o \\\\u0111\\\\u1ea3m \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1ee3c hoa\\\\u0300n toa\\\\u0300n chi\\\\u0301nh xa\\\\u0301c. Th\\u00f4ng tin cung c\\\\u1ea5p ch\\\\u1ec9 cho tham kh\\\\u1ea3o, n\\\\u1ebfu th\\u00f4ng tin D\\\\u1ef1 \\\\u0110o\\u00e1n KQXSKT tr\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc gi\\\\u1edd quay kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u00ednh x\\u00e1c g\\u00e2y ra b\\\\u1ea5t k\\u00ec t\\\\u1ed5n th\\\\u1ea5t n\\u00e0o cho m\\\\u1ecdi ng\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddi, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng ch\\\\u1ecbu tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\\\u1ec7m.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>\\\\u2043<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> T\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ea3 qu\\\\u1ea3ng ca\\\\u0301o tr\\u00ean web ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i, \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1u la\\\\u0300 y\\\\u0301 ki\\\\u1ebfn ca\\\\u0301 nh\\u00e2n c\\\\u1ee7a kha\\\\u0301ch ha\\\\u0300ng, kh\\u00f4ng li\\u00ean quan g\\u00ec v\\\\u1edbi web ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>\\\\u2043<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> T\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ea3 \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddng link qu\\\\u1ea3ng c\\u00e1o tr\\u00ean web ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i, b\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ee9 h\\u00ecnh th\\\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0o, mi\\\\u1ec5n ph\\u00ed, thu ph\\u00ed, ho\\\\u1eb7c c\\u00f4ng \\u00edch, \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec1u ph\\\\u1ea3i tu\\u00e2n theo ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt quy \\\\u0111\\\\u1ecbnh, n\\\\u1ed9i dung kh\\u00f4ng \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1ee3c li\\u00ean quan t\\\\u1edbi nh\\\\u1eefng n\\\\u1ed9i dung c\\u00f3 h\\\\u1ea1i nh\\\\u01b0 vi ph\\\\u1ea1m ph\\u00e1p lu\\\\u1eadt, ho\\\\u1ea1t \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9ng ph\\\\u1ea3n \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9ng, m\\u00ea t\\u00edn, m\\\\u1ea1i d\\u00e2m, v.v<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p><span style=\\\\\\\"color: red;\\\\\\\"><strong>\\\\u2043<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/span> N\\\\u1ebfu vi ph\\\\u1ea1m, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i c\\u00f3 quy\\\\u1ec1n x\\u00f3a b\\\\u1ecf \\\\u0111\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddng link li\\u00ean quan b\\\\u1ea5t c\\\\u1ee9 khi n\\u00e0o m\\u00e0 l\\\\u1ea1i kh\\u00f4ng ho\\u00e0n l\\\\u1ea1i ph\\u00ed, \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed3ng th\\\\u1eddi c\\u00f3 quy\\\\u1ec1n l\\\\u1ee3i v\\u00e0 ngh\\\\u0129a v\\\\u1ee5 c\\u00f9ng c\\u00e1c b\\\\u1ed9 li\\u00ean quan h\\\\u1ee3p t\\u00e1c truy c\\\\u1ee9u.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/div>\\\",\\\"text_run\\\":\\\"<div class=\\\\\\\"marquee-text\\\\\\\">\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0<img src=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/vietnam.gif\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"l\\u00e1 c\\\\u1edd vi\\\\u1ec7t nam\\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\\"36\\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\\"25\\\\\\\"> \\u00a0 \\u00a0 <span style=\\\\\\\"font-size: 18px; color: #ee0000;\\\\\\\"> SoiCauMB247.Net <\\\\\\/span>\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 <img src=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/bonghoa.gif\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"b\\u00f4ng hoa\\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\\"14\\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\\"12\\\\\\\"> \\u00a0 \\u00a0 <span style=\\\\\\\"color: #009933;\\\\\\\">Trang Di\\\\u1ec5n \\\\u0111\\u00e0n th\\\\u1ea3o lu\\\\u1eadn x\\\\u1ed5 s\\\\u1ed1 soi c\\\\u1ea7u TOP 1 Vi\\\\u1ec7t Nam <\\\\\\/span> \\u00a0 \\u00a0 <img src=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/vietnam_1.gif\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"l\\u00e1 c\\\\u1edd vi\\\\u1ec7t nam\\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\\"36\\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\\"25\\\\\\\"> \\u00a0 \\u00a0<\\\\\\/div>\\\"}\",\"_token\":\"iXNRDJtybanP8L8VrzGzDFeqrxEHxFqAUbP7KzHa\",\"_method\":\"PUT\"}', '2025-11-11 00:16:03', '2025-11-11 00:16:03'),
