(1423, 1, 'admin/settings/1', 'PUT', '2402:800:6105:7787:31f1:d173:fbca:c99e', '{\"name\":\"tajsc\",\"address\":\"S\\u1ed1 103 V\\u1ea1n Ph\\u00fac, TDP 10, Ph\\u01b0\\u1eddng H\\u00e0 \\u0110\\u00f4ng, Th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ed1 H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i, Vi\\u1ec7t Nam\",\"phone\":\"0912333265\",\"zalo\":\"0912333265\",\"telegram\":\"@nuoilo66\",\"email\":\"info@tajsc.vn\",\"email_receive\":\"info@tajsc.vn\",\"soicau\":\"<p class=\\\"banner_text\\\">C&ocirc;ng ty C\\u1ed5 Ph\\u1ea7n Chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0110\\u1ed5i D\\u1eef Li\\u1ec7u S\\u1ed1 Tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng An (TRUONG AN DIGITAL DATA CONVERSION JOINT STOCK COMPANY ) th&agrave;nh l\\u1eadp n\\u0103m 2025, v\\u1edbi m\\u1ee5c ti&ecirc;u cung c\\u1ea5p d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 v&agrave; gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i s\\u1ed1 chuy&ecirc;n s&acirc;u trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c giao th&ocirc;ng cho kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng trong v&agrave; ngo&agrave;i n\\u01b0\\u1edbc.&nbsp;<br><br>Th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n s&aacute;ng l\\u1eadp c\\u1ee7a Tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng An l&agrave; c&aacute;c chuy&ecirc;n gia c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 gi&agrave;u kinh nghi\\u1ec7m, \\u0111&atilde; nhi\\u1ec1u n\\u0103m t\\u1eadn t\\u1ee5y v&agrave; \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h&agrave;nh v\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n c\\u1ee7a \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 th&ocirc;ng tin ng&agrave;nh giao th&ocirc;ng&nbsp;. V\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1ed9i ng\\u0169 k\\u1ef9 s\\u01b0 tr\\u1ebb c&oacute; n\\u0103ng l\\u1ef1c, kh&aacute;t khao v&agrave; \\u0111am m&ecirc; s&aacute;ng t\\u1ea1o, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i ch&uacute; tr\\u1ecdng \\u0111\\u1eb7t m&igrave;nh v&agrave;o v\\u1ecb tr&iacute; c\\u1ee7a ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d&ugrave;ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u1ea1o ra nh\\u1eefng s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i v\\u1edbi phong c&aacute;ch l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p nh\\u1ea5t. Trong th\\u1eddi gian t\\u1edbi, Tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng An s\\u1ebd ti&ecirc;n phong ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n c&aacute;c gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i s\\u1ed1 giao th&ocirc;ng chuy&ecirc;n s&acirc;u v\\u1edbi m\\u1ee5c ti&ecirc;u &ldquo;\\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n nh\\u01b0ng hi\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3&rdquo;. Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i cam k\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h&agrave;nh l&acirc;u d&agrave;i v\\u1edbi kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 c&ugrave;ng ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n, s&aacute;ng t\\u1ea1o, \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng hi\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3 c&aacute;c n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng s\\u1ed1 giao th&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;ng minh v\\u1edbi chi ph&iacute; t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u nh\\u1ea5t.<\\/p>\",\"title1\":\"T\\u01af V\\u1ea4N\",\"text1\":\"<ul>\\r\\n<li>L\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ec1 &aacute;n, k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i s\\u1ed1 giao th&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;ng minh<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng kho c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; h\\u1ed3 s\\u01a1 ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ti\\u1ec7n t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p s\\u1ed1 h&oacute;a v&agrave; qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; c&aacute;c th\\u1ee7 t\\u1ee5c giao th&ocirc;ng<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p cung c\\u1ea5p d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u m\\u1edf&nbsp;<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"title2\":\"PH\\u1ea6N M\\u1ec0M\",\"text2\":\"<ul class=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n<li>Ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; l\\u1ecbch \\u0111\\u0103ng ki\\u1ec3m, tr\\u1ea1ng th&aacute;i \\u0111\\u0103ng ki\\u1ec3m<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m \\u0111\\u1eb7t h\\u1eb9n \\u0111\\u0103ng ki\\u1ec3m tr\\u1ef1c tuy\\u1ebfn<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; ph\\u1ea1t ngu\\u1ed9i, th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o ph\\u1ea1t ngu\\u1ed9i<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ti\\u1ec7n giao th&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;ng minh<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; ti\\u1ec7n &iacute;ch giao th&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;ng minh<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"title3\":\"T\\u00cdCH H\\u1ee2P, GIA C\\u00d4NG\",\"texttag\":\"<ul>\\r\\n<li>Gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p t&iacute;ch h\\u1ee3p d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf, x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng website chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p cho c\\u01a1 quan, t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c, doanh nghi\\u1ec7p<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n, gia c&ocirc;ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m chuy&ecirc;n bi\\u1ec7t l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c y t\\u1ebf<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 b\\u1ea3o tr&igrave;, h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 v\\u1eadn h&agrave;nh h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng th&ocirc;ng tin y t\\u1ebf<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cung c\\u1ea5p thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 th&ocirc;ng tin chuy&ecirc;n d\\u1ee5ng trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c y t\\u1ebf<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"copyright\":\"<div class=\\\"col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-8\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"tscct_txt\\\">V\\u1edbi nhi\\u1ec1u n\\u0103m kinh nghi\\u1ec7m th\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec5n, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i th\\u1ea5u hi\\u1ec3u t\\u1ea7m quan tr\\u1ecdng c\\u1ee7a vi\\u1ec7c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c&aacute;c n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 s\\u1ed1 trong chu\\u1ed7i gi&aacute; tr\\u1ecb d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 c\\u1ee7a qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch.<br>Tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng An cam k\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h&agrave;nh b\\u1eb1ng s\\u1ef1 \\u0111\\u1ea3m b\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec1 d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 b\\u1ea3o tr&igrave;, h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 24\\/7 t\\u1edbi m\\u1ecdi kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng trong su\\u1ed1t th\\u1eddi gian cung c\\u1ea5p d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5, v\\u1edbi quy tr&igrave;nh \\u0111\\u1ea3m b\\u1ea3o th\\u1ef1c thi chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul class=\\\"tscct_lst\\\">\\r\\n<li>Kh\\u1ea3o s&aacute;t, ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn th&ocirc;ng tin c\\u1ee7a kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>K&yacute; cam k\\u1ebft b\\u1ea3o m\\u1eadt th&ocirc;ng tin<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ul class=\\\"tscct_lst\\\">\\r\\n<li>T\\u01b0 v\\u1ea5n, l\\u1eadp k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch tri\\u1ec3n khai d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n c&agrave;i \\u0111\\u1eb7t, hi\\u1ec7u ch\\u1ec9nh h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ul class=\\\"tscct_lst\\\">\\r\\n<li>Th\\u1ed1ng nh\\u1ea5t quy tr&igrave;nh, ph\\u1ea1m vi d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cung c\\u1ea5p d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3, v\\u1eadn h&agrave;nh 24\\/7<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"textfooter\":\"<p class=\\\"f_text\\\">Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i hi\\u1ec3u r&otilde; kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; m\\u1ed9t gi\\u1ea3i ph&aacute;p to&agrave;n di\\u1ec7n n&agrave;o gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c m\\u1ecdi v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1, tuy nhi&ecirc;n lu&ocirc;n t\\u1ed3n t\\u1ea1i m\\u1ed9t l\\u1eddi gi\\u1ea3i t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u cho m\\u1ed9t y&ecirc;u c\\u1ea7u nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5 c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3.<br><br>Tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng An kh&aacute;t khao \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h&agrave;nh v\\u1edbi qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 c&ugrave;ng tham gia gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft t\\u1eebng b&agrave;i to&aacute;n c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3. Chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i nh\\u1eefng kh&aacute;i ni\\u1ec7m tr\\u1eebu t\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng c\\u1ee7a chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i s\\u1ed1 y t\\u1ebf th&agrave;nh nh\\u1eefng c&ocirc;ng c\\u1ee5, ti\\u1ec7n &iacute;ch ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n, d\\u1ec5 ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn v\\u1edbi chi ph&iacute; t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u nh\\u1ea5t.<\\/p>\",\"site_title\":\"tajsc\",\"meta_description\":\"tajsc\",\"content\":\"{\\\"soicau\\\":\\\"<p class=\\\\\\\"banner_text\\\\\\\">C\\u00f4ng ty C\\\\u1ed5 Ph\\\\u1ea7n Chuy\\\\u1ec3n \\\\u0110\\\\u1ed5i D\\\\u1eef Li\\\\u1ec7u S\\\\u1ed1 Tr\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddng An (TRUONG AN DIGITAL DATA CONVERSION JOINT STOCK COMPANY ) th\\u00e0nh l\\\\u1eadp n\\\\u0103m 2025, v\\\\u1edbi m\\\\u1ee5c ti\\u00eau cung c\\\\u1ea5p d\\\\u1ecbch v\\\\u1ee5 v\\u00e0 gi\\\\u1ea3i ph\\u00e1p chuy\\\\u1ec3n \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed5i s\\\\u1ed1 chuy\\u00ean s\\u00e2u trong l\\\\u0129nh v\\\\u1ef1c giao th\\u00f4ng cho kh\\u00e1ch h\\u00e0ng trong v\\u00e0 ngo\\u00e0i n\\\\u01b0\\\\u1edbc.\\u00a0<br><br>Th\\u00e0nh vi\\u00ean s\\u00e1ng l\\\\u1eadp c\\\\u1ee7a Tr\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddng An l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c chuy\\u00ean gia c\\u00f4ng ngh\\\\u1ec7 gi\\u00e0u kinh nghi\\\\u1ec7m, \\\\u0111\\u00e3 nhi\\\\u1ec1u n\\\\u0103m t\\\\u1eadn t\\\\u1ee5y v\\u00e0 \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed3ng h\\u00e0nh v\\\\u1edbi s\\\\u1ef1 ph\\u00e1t tri\\\\u1ec3n c\\\\u1ee7a \\\\u1ee9ng d\\\\u1ee5ng c\\u00f4ng ngh\\\\u1ec7 th\\u00f4ng tin ng\\u00e0nh y t\\\\u1ebf. V\\\\u1edbi \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed9i ng\\\\u0169 k\\\\u1ef9 s\\\\u01b0 tr\\\\u1ebb c\\u00f3 n\\\\u0103ng l\\\\u1ef1c, kh\\u00e1t khao v\\u00e0 \\\\u0111am m\\u00ea s\\u00e1ng t\\\\u1ea1o, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i ch\\u00fa tr\\\\u1ecdng \\\\u0111\\\\u1eb7t m\\u00ecnh v\\u00e0o v\\\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed c\\\\u1ee7a ng\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec3 t\\\\u1ea1o ra nh\\\\u1eefng s\\\\u1ea3n ph\\\\u1ea9m c\\u00f4ng ngh\\\\u1ec7 hi\\\\u1ec7n \\\\u0111\\\\u1ea1i v\\\\u1edbi phong c\\u00e1ch l\\u00e0m vi\\\\u1ec7c chuy\\u00ean nghi\\\\u1ec7p nh\\\\u1ea5t. Trong th\\\\u1eddi gian t\\\\u1edbi, Tr\\\\u01b0\\\\u1eddng An s\\\\u1ebd ti\\u00ean phong ph\\u00e1t tri\\\\u1ec3n c\\u00e1c gi\\\\u1ea3i ph\\u00e1p \\\\u1ee9ng d\\\\u1ee5ng chuy\\\\u1ec3n \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed5i s\\\\u1ed1 giao th\\u00f4ng chuy\\u00ean s\\u00e2u v\\\\u1edbi m\\\\u1ee5c ti\\u00eau \\u201c\\\\u0111\\\\u01a1n gi\\\\u1ea3n nh\\\\u01b0ng hi\\\\u1ec7u qu\\\\u1ea3\\u201d. Ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i cam k\\\\u1ebft \\\\u0111\\\\u1ed3ng h\\u00e0nh l\\u00e2u d\\u00e0i v\\\\u1edbi kh\\u00e1ch h\\u00e0ng \\\\u0111\\\\u1ec3 c\\u00f9ng ph\\u00e1t tri\\\\u1ec3n, s\\u00e1ng t\\\\u1ea1o, \\\\u1ee9ng d\\\\u1ee5ng hi\\\\u1ec7u qu\\\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c n\\\\u1ec1n t\\\\u1ea3ng s\\\\u1ed1 giao th\\u00f4ng th\\u00f4ng minh v\\\\u1edbi chi ph\\u00ed t\\\\u1ed1i \\\\u01b0u nh\\\\u1ea5t.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"title1\\\":\\\"T\\\\u01af V\\\\u1ea4N\\\",\\\"title2\\\":\\\"PH\\\\u1ea6N M\\\\u1ec0M\\\",\\\"title3\\\":\\\"T\\\\u00cdCH H\\\\u1ee2P, GIA C\\\\u00d4NG\\\",\\\"zalo\\\":\\\"0912888999\\\"}\",\"_token\":\"3ZYYti961OeTlFbe7QjcOIpvgWaQx90F5rgvvaSP\",\"_method\":\"PUT\"}', '2025-11-12 18:51:17', '2025-11-12 18:51:17'),
